  <p>Every signal follows the same pipeline. We collect results and statistics across the leagues we track, then run them through three independent views: an <strong>ELO rating system</strong> that learns from every result, <strong>Monte Carlo simulations</strong> that explore possible outcomes, and <strong>team-statistics models</strong> that measure playing style and pace. These views are combined into one probability and compared to the market's consensus. When the gap is meaningful, the signal qualifies. The strongest signals go out by email and through a machine-readable JSON API, so the output is easy to integrate into any workflow.</p>

